    "body": "### Motivation\n\nMake nutritional values collapsible per product in Compare mode so users can expand or collapse to focus on relevant data.\n\n### Proposed solution\n\nImplement an accordion or collapse control for the nutritional values section for each product in Compare mode. Default collapsed state is suggested to reduce visual clutter.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Nutritional section can expand/collapse per product.\n- [ ] Default state is collapsed (or as decided).\n- [ ] State persists while on the comparison view and is accessible.\n\n### Design / mockup\n\n_No response_\n\n### Alternatives considered\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\nParent: #1557",
